[00:03.860]
[00:06.310]
[00:09.720]
[00:21.430]I've come here from nowhere (我从虚无至此)
[00:24.750]Cross the unforgiving sea (穿过冷漠的海洋)
[00:27.270]Drifting further and further (漂得越来越远)
[00:30.360]It's all becoming clear to me (对我来说一切越来越清晰)
[00:32.760]But violent winds are upon us and I can't sleep (但是暴风自头上吹过我无法入眠)
[00:38.510]Internal temperatures rising (心中的温度在上升)
[00:42.020]And all the voices won't recede (一切的声音不会消退)
[00:44.590]
[00:45.350]I've finally found what I was looking for (我终于找到了我一直在找的东西)
[00:51.190]A place where I can be without remorse (一个我可以不用后悔的地方)
[00:57.040]Because I am a stranger who has found (因为我是个发现自己是个陌生人的人)
[01:00.490]An even stranger war (陷入一个更奇怪的战争中)
[01:02.870]I've finally found what I was looking for (我终于找到了我一直在找的东西)
[01:10.170]Here I come (我来到这里)
[01:14.120]
[01:25.030]La chaleur me derange (热的我好烦)
[01:27.930]Mais c'est le grincement du bateau qui m'a reveille (但是喊声唤醒了我)
[01:32.150]
[01:33.450]I sharpen the knife (轻磨这沾满鲜血的刀锋)
[01:37.280]And look down upon the bay (蔑视著流尽鲜血的苍白尸体)
[01:40.360]For all of my life (这真是我人生最美妙的全部)
[01:43.540]A stranger I remain (我依然只是个陌生人)
[01:49.390]A stranger I remain (我一直都是个陌生人)
[01:55.250]A stranger I remain (我终究是个陌生人)
[02:00.560]
